cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "age-offsite-backups"
abstract: >-
  Bash toolkit that encrypts backup files with age on the backup host, to two
  public keys, before uploading them to S3-compatible object storage, fails
  closed rather than upload plaintext, and verifies on a separate machine that
  every encrypted object decrypts to its original SHA-256.
authors:
